From 11e49aca1a7a074b5bcea2738940209651f19cd0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:48:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add chat sidebar: new chat, saved chat list, profile menu
 with log out

Gemini-style sidebar (drawer on phones). Chats are saved per student profile in new conversations table (run supabase/migrations/002_chat_history.sql). /api/chat now saves messages and returns a friendly message instead of crashing when the AI model is unreachable. Privacy policy updated: chats are now saved.
